- [x] Handle lab()/lch() functions → CssValue (COLOR)
  - [x] Modern syntax only: lab(L a b) / lch(L C H) - no legacy comma syntax
  - [x] L (Lightness): percentage or number (0-100), clamped to [0,100]
  - [x] a, b (Lab): signed numbers or percentages (-100% to 100% → -125 to 125)
  - [x] C (Chroma): ≥0, percentage maps to 0-150 range
  - [x] H (Hue): angle with deg, rad, grad, turn units
  - [x] Alpha channel: lab(50 40 -30 / 0.5), lch(50 60 180 / 50%)
  - [x] Lab to XYZ to sRGB conversion per W3C CSS Color 4 spec
  - [x] LCH to Lab conversion (polar to cartesian)
  - [x] Gamma correction for sRGB output
  - [x] Tests: 36 tests for lab/lch parsing (CssColorFunctionParserTests.cs)
- [x] Handle oklab()/oklch() functions → CssValue (COLOR)
  - [x] Modern syntax only: oklab(L a b) / oklch(L C H) - no legacy comma syntax
  - [x] L (Lightness): percentage or number (0-1), clamped to [0,1]
  - [x] a, b (OKLab): signed numbers or percentages (-100% to 100% → -0.4 to 0.4)
  - [x] C (Chroma): ≥0, percentage maps to 0-0.4 range
  - [x] H (Hue): angle with deg, rad, grad, turn units
  - [x] Alpha channel: oklab(0.5 0.1 -0.1 / 0.5), oklch(0.5 0.15 180 / 50%)
  - [x] OKLab to XYZ to sRGB conversion per W3C CSS Color 4 spec
  - [x] OKLCh to OKLab conversion (polar to cartesian)
  - [x] Tests: 35 tests for oklab/oklch parsing (CssColorFunctionParserTests.cs)
- [x] Handle color() function for custom color spaces
  - [x] Modern syntax only: color(<color-space> c1 c2 c3 [/ alpha]) - no legacy comma syntax
  - [x] Predefined RGB color spaces: srgb, srgb-linear, display-p3, a98-rgb, prophoto-rgb, rec2020
  - [x] XYZ color spaces: xyz, xyz-d50, xyz-d65 (xyz is alias for xyz-d65)
  - [x] Component values: number [0-1] or percentage [0%-100%], out-of-gamut allowed
  - [x] Alpha channel: color(srgb 1 0 0 / 0.5), color(display-p3 1 0 0 / 50%)
